<title>ITALY: Italy's Manuli Rubber share offer oversubscibed.</title>
<headline>Italy's Manuli Rubber share offer oversubscibed.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Manuli Rubber Industries said its pre-bourse listing share placement had closed with demand for almost seven times the 26 million shares on offer.</p>
<p>The rubber tubing multinational company said in a statement that domestic and foreign institutional investors had bid for over 142 million shares against the 18.2 million on offer while the public offer of 7.8 million shares had seen demand for over 35 million. The offer took place on July 7 and 8.</p>
<p>Priced at 5,650 lire, the stock is expected to start trading on the Milan stock market on July 21.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
